     <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
         <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Datenbasierter Service erhÃ¶ht ProduktivitÃ¤t, Effizienz und QualitÃ¤t in der Prozessindustrie / Data-driven service enhances productivity, efficiency and quality in the process industry</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:title>
     <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
         <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Mit Control Performance Analytics stellt Siemens auf der SPS IPC Drives 2014 einen neuen datenbasierten Service fÃ¼r die Prozessindustrie vor.

With Control Performance Analytics, Siemens is presenting a new data-driven service for the process industry at the SPS IPC Drives show 2014.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
     <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
         <rdf:li>siemens</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>presse</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>press</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Pressebilder</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Presspictures</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Kontinuierliche Analyse der Prozessdaten von Regelkreisen</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Anlagenoptimierung</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Steigerung</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Schnelle Einrichtung nach "Plug &amp; Play"-Prinzip</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Prozess- und Zustandsdaten von Regelkreisen (Control Loops) aus dem Prozessleitsystem Simatic PCS 7</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Plant Data Services</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Continuous analysis of process data for control loops</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>plant optimization</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Fast setup according to the "plug &amp; play" principle</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>service</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>process and status data from control loops are captured by the Simatic PCS 7 process control system</rdf:li>
         <rdf:li>Plant Data Services</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Bag>
   </dc:subject>
